        "reference": "Psalms 17:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Keep me as the apple of the eye, hide me under the shadow of thy wings,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 17:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "From the wicked that oppress me, from my deadly enemies, who compass me about.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 37
          },
          {
            "start": 57,
            "end": 60
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 17:9",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "They are inclosed in their own fat: with their mouth they speak proudly.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 17:10",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "They have now compassed us in our steps: they have set their eyes bowing down to the earth;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 66,
            "end": 72,
            "text": "OR to cast us to earth."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 17:11",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Like as a lion that is greedy of his prey, and as it were a young lion lurking in secret places.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 19
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 17:12",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "Arise, O Lord, disappoint him, cast him down: deliver my soul from the wicked, which is thy sword:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 79,
            "end": 87,
            "text": "OR by."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 79,
